Package: grub-efi-arm64-signed
Description-md5: 3dc9f83cbf79de45aa7b6b3a17c07a6f
Description-en: GRand Unified Bootloader, version 2 (EFI-ARM64 version, signed)
 GRUB is a portable, powerful bootloader.  This version of GRUB is based on a
